18:43.957 --> 18:48.378
Kau benar-benar keterlaluan, Panty!

18:49.712 --> 18:52.715
- Jangan macam-macam, Stocking!
- Panty!

18:53.341 --> 18:55.717
Pusar ibumu pasti bodong!

18:55.718 --> 18:57.929
