21:30.957 --> 21:36.294
<i>Panty dan Stocking!</i>

21:36.295 --> 21:40.258
<i>Panty dan Stocking!</i>

21:42.010 --> 21:44.469
<i>Panty dan Stocking.</i>

21:44.470 --> 21:46.097
<i>Kembali ke rumah.</i>

